WEBVTT

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:07.614
That woman is our new superior?

00:00:07.614 --> 00:00:08.615
That's correct.

00:00:08.615 --> 00:00:11.785
You and she will be
on the same team as of today.

00:00:11.785 --> 00:00:13.153
Please wait a minute!

00:00:13.153 --> 00:00:14.921
Do you know?

00:00:14.921 --> 00:00:16.723
That woman is a thief.

00:00:16.723 --> 00:00:19.526
Our company has also fallen victim
to her crimes many times.

00:00:19.526 --> 00:00:20.760
And you are making such a person...

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.329
Did I not tell you?

00:00:22.329 --> 00:00:26.433
That I do not care in the least
about education or personal history.

00:00:26.433 --> 00:00:29.469
She is a superior individual,
so I will make her your superior.

00:00:29.469 --> 00:00:30.837
That is all there is to it.

00:00:30.837 --> 00:00:32.005
Division Chief.

00:00:32.005 --> 00:00:33.773
What is it, Integra?

00:00:33.773 --> 00:00:36.409
I understand your intentions.

00:00:36.409 --> 00:00:39.679
However, we are not ordinary individuals.

00:00:39.679 --> 00:00:41.848
Yes, and you need not worry
on that score, either.

00:00:41.848 --> 00:00:46.152
Like you, Rose is a Proceed.

00:00:46.152 --> 00:00:49.122
Now, are we done with the questions?

00:00:49.122 --> 00:00:53.526
Then, starting tomorrow,
you will take your orders from her.

00:00:53.526 --> 00:00:56.154
Rose, introduce yourself to everyone.

00:00:57.297 --> 00:01:00.664
I'm Rose Anderson. I look
forward to working with you.

00:01:03.269 --> 00:01:11.011
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I've wanted to hear about?

00:01:11.011 --> 00:01:17.678
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:01:19.219 --> 00:01:29.162
It's like we were both seeking
a coincidence that was off by a page

00:01:29.162 --> 00:01:31.331
And that's how fate brought us together

00:01:31.331 --> 00:01:39.506
More than those words
that you once kept to yourself

00:01:39.506 --> 00:01:48.415
It's the kindness
that made you keep them to yourself

00:01:48.415 --> 00:01:55.422
That I want to have faith in now

00:01:55.422 --> 00:02:03.096
You know, we'll be living
alongside uncertainty from now on

00:02:03.096 --> 00:02:09.502
We used to have nothing to lose,
but that's not us now

00:02:09.502 --> 00:02:17.177
You know the continuation of
the fairy tale I didn't know about before?

00:02:17.177 --> 00:02:23.516
If it's eternal happiness,
I'll forge it with my own hand

00:02:23.516 --> 00:02:27.418
It's something to build up bit by bit

00:02:45.102 --> 00:02:46.937
- Joseph?
- Yeah.

00:02:46.937 --> 00:02:50.841
An eccentric old man who lives
in a cottage all by himself.

00:02:50.841 --> 00:02:53.344
He might know something.

00:02:53.344 --> 00:02:54.912
Where is that cottage?

00:02:54.912 --> 00:02:57.314
Due west a ways from here.

00:02:57.314 --> 00:02:58.749
The road is...

00:02:58.749 --> 00:03:02.742
Wait, I'll draw a map
with landmarks to help you find it.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:08.183
Guess I'll just have to go check it out.

00:03:14.632 --> 00:03:16.300
I won't acknowledge her!

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:20.571
A former thief like her our superior?!

00:03:20.571 --> 00:03:23.808
How could I possibly acknowledge her?!

00:03:23.808 --> 00:03:25.643
How do you feel about it, Integra?

00:03:25.643 --> 00:03:27.812
What?

00:03:27.812 --> 00:03:30.714
I'll follow the division chief's orders.

00:03:30.714 --> 00:03:31.782
What about you, Celica?

00:03:31.782 --> 00:03:36.220
I don't care either way,
as long as I get paid.

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:40.191
I-I am... Well, I am not really sure.

00:03:40.191 --> 00:03:42.693
Morning!

00:03:42.693 --> 00:03:44.328
Good morning.

00:03:44.328 --> 00:03:45.529
Good morning.

00:03:45.529 --> 00:03:47.398
Morning!

00:03:47.398 --> 00:03:50.959
Man, this building is so huge, I got lost.

00:03:53.037 --> 00:03:54.538
I feel so sleepy!

00:03:54.538 --> 00:03:57.141
That my seat over there?

00:03:57.141 --> 00:03:58.642
Yes, this is yours.

00:03:58.642 --> 00:03:59.810
I figured as much.

00:03:59.810 --> 00:04:02.540
Well, it's the only free chair anyway.

00:04:07.518 --> 00:04:10.421
Chief, forgive me so soon
on your first day,

00:04:10.421 --> 00:04:12.590
but I'll need your signature
on this document.

00:04:12.590 --> 00:04:16.293
Do me a favor, would you
stop with the "Chief" thing?

00:04:16.293 --> 00:04:18.362
It's kind of a drag.

00:04:18.362 --> 00:04:19.761
Okay...

00:04:20.998 --> 00:04:25.059
I just need to look over
that document and sign it, right?

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.706
Leave it there.

00:04:28.706 --> 00:04:29.840
Okay...

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:32.543
What? Is it urgent?

00:04:32.543 --> 00:04:34.078
Not exactly...

00:04:34.078 --> 00:04:36.780
Then I'll look at it later,
so leave it there.

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:38.415
Begging your pardon!

00:04:38.415 --> 00:04:41.118
I don't think your attitude is appropriate.

00:04:41.118 --> 00:04:43.120
On your very first day, no less!

00:04:43.120 --> 00:04:44.188
Silvia.

00:04:44.188 --> 00:04:45.389
It's not?

00:04:45.389 --> 00:04:47.458
Anyone with any common sense
would think so.

00:04:47.458 --> 00:04:50.561
Common sense, huh?

00:04:50.561 --> 00:04:54.298
All right, then let me take this
opportunity to tell you my policy.

00:04:54.298 --> 00:04:57.201
I believe results are all that count.

00:04:57.201 --> 00:04:58.536
As long as you get results,

00:04:58.536 --> 00:05:01.038
I don't care about how you got there,

00:05:01.038 --> 00:05:04.575
even if that includes goofing off
or taking naps during work hours.

00:05:04.575 --> 00:05:06.710
- Really?
- Really.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:08.701
Way to go! Terrific!

00:05:11.882 --> 00:05:14.851
Yes? This is Security Department,
Special Duty Section 7.

00:05:17.288 --> 00:05:18.222
All right.

00:05:18.222 --> 00:05:18.956
Chief.

00:05:18.956 --> 00:05:20.190
It's "Rose."

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:23.294
Oh, right. I mean Rose...

00:05:23.294 --> 00:05:25.990
We have a mobilization request
from Security Department Section 4.

00:05:30.901 --> 00:05:32.368
That must be it.

00:05:40.911 --> 00:05:42.538
It's open.

00:05:45.883 --> 00:05:48.010
Are you Joseph?

00:05:49.853 --> 00:05:51.288
And you are?

00:05:51.288 --> 00:05:53.119
I'm looking for someone.

00:05:56.393 --> 00:05:58.862
This girl.

00:05:58.862 --> 00:06:01.532
If you're looking for Solty,
she went back...

00:06:01.532 --> 00:06:04.194
...to where she belongs.

00:06:10.407 --> 00:06:11.635
Strange...

00:06:12.776 --> 00:06:16.880
Three targets: Two men and one woman.

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:22.820
They attacked an RUC transport
on 47th Street 30 minutes ago.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.254
The woman is a native.

00:06:24.254 --> 00:06:28.892
One man has both arms resemblized,
the other man, both legs.

00:06:28.892 --> 00:06:31.862
Silvia! Celica! Are you ready?

00:06:31.862 --> 00:06:33.497
Any time.

00:06:33.497 --> 00:06:35.899
Okay here as well!

00:06:35.899 --> 00:06:38.736
We're ready to move in...

00:06:38.736 --> 00:06:40.404
Do we have your permission?

00:06:40.404 --> 00:06:42.773
Sure, go ahead.

00:06:42.773 --> 00:06:44.274
Commence operation!

00:06:44.274 --> 00:06:46.410
Roger that!

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.607
Let's see just how good you are.

00:06:53.684 --> 00:06:54.918
How's it look?

00:06:54.918 --> 00:06:58.022
Looks clear. No sign of cops.

00:06:58.022 --> 00:07:00.320
All right, let's go.

00:07:04.228 --> 00:07:06.130
What was that?!

00:07:06.130 --> 00:07:07.798
One down.

00:07:07.798 --> 00:07:08.966
Snipers?

00:07:08.966 --> 00:07:10.334
This is bad! Run!

00:07:10.334 --> 00:07:11.631
The back door!

00:07:15.572 --> 00:07:17.875
You're not getting away!

00:07:17.875 --> 00:07:19.206
Damn you!

00:07:25.315 --> 00:07:27.283
Do it! Quickly!

00:07:28.419 --> 00:07:29.818
Damn it!

00:07:33.991 --> 00:07:35.092
What happened?

00:07:35.092 --> 00:07:36.827
Silvia!

00:07:36.827 --> 00:07:38.796
What happened, Silvia?

00:07:38.796 --> 00:07:40.631
Respond!

00:07:40.631 --> 00:07:42.733
Celica, can you hear me?

00:07:42.733 --> 00:07:44.501
What do you see from your position?

00:07:44.501 --> 00:07:45.536
I can't see anything!

00:07:45.536 --> 00:07:47.871
They used a flash grenade!

00:07:47.871 --> 00:07:48.906
What about Silvia?!

00:07:48.906 --> 00:07:51.408
I don't know!

00:07:51.408 --> 00:07:52.898
Honestly...

00:07:54.978 --> 00:07:57.047
It's no good. At this rate...

00:07:57.047 --> 00:07:58.716
Shoot.

00:07:58.716 --> 00:08:03.387
Even a random shot might get lucky
and reduce the target's strength.

00:08:03.387 --> 00:08:04.488
Are you sure?

00:08:04.488 --> 00:08:06.390
She can survive a hit, right?

00:08:06.390 --> 00:08:07.925
That's an order!

00:08:07.925 --> 00:08:09.493
Don't do it, Celica!

00:08:09.493 --> 00:08:11.051
Yeah, right?

00:08:14.098 --> 00:08:15.998
Damn, I can't see.

00:08:22.606 --> 00:08:24.073
Bullseye!

00:08:25.743 --> 00:08:28.579
Start by reducing the opposition's mobility.

00:08:28.579 --> 00:08:29.580
Elementary, right?

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:32.140
You! Rose?!

00:08:36.286 --> 00:08:38.722
Rose, what do you think you're doing?!

00:08:38.722 --> 00:08:43.455
Sorry. I work for the RUC now.

00:08:45.195 --> 00:08:46.730
It's over.

00:08:46.730 --> 00:08:48.561
Operation complete.

00:08:53.637 --> 00:08:55.606
I'm beat!

00:08:55.606 --> 00:08:58.075
I can't wait to take a shower.

00:08:58.075 --> 00:08:59.610
You said it.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.944
Good work.

00:09:00.944 --> 00:09:02.713
D-Division Chief...

00:09:02.713 --> 00:09:06.350
I heard your communications log.

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:08.952
Are your eyes okay?

00:09:08.952 --> 00:09:12.189
Y-Yes! Thank you very much for asking.

00:09:12.189 --> 00:09:13.590
They're fine now.

00:09:13.590 --> 00:09:16.894
So? What did you think
of your first mission?

00:09:16.894 --> 00:09:18.996
Well, it was about what I expected.

00:09:18.996 --> 00:09:20.631
You did well.

00:09:20.631 --> 00:09:22.666
I know you were testing me.

00:09:22.666 --> 00:09:23.834
All right, all right.

00:09:23.834 --> 00:09:27.437
I know you're tired,
but I'd like a word with you.

00:09:27.437 --> 00:09:28.972
Would you come with me?

00:09:28.972 --> 00:09:30.667
Sure, why not.

00:09:33.443 --> 00:09:35.078
Chief.

00:09:35.078 --> 00:09:37.581
I said you could call me Rose.

00:09:37.581 --> 00:09:40.884
Would you mind facing me
in a mock battle?

00:09:40.884 --> 00:09:42.186
A mock battle?

00:09:42.186 --> 00:09:45.322
The division chief said
he placed you above us

00:09:45.322 --> 00:09:47.724
because you were superior to us.

00:09:47.724 --> 00:09:50.527
In that case, if I defeat you,

00:09:50.527 --> 00:09:53.864
we might switch positions, right?

00:09:53.864 --> 00:09:57.201
What's this? You want to be the chief?

00:09:57.201 --> 00:10:00.762
If that is the way it should be.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.375
Sounds fun.

00:10:05.375 --> 00:10:07.309
Okay, let's do it.

00:10:44.047 --> 00:10:45.148
What're the rules?

00:10:45.148 --> 00:10:46.650
Do we stop just before making contact?

00:10:46.650 --> 00:10:48.752
Full contact, the same as actual combat.

00:10:48.752 --> 00:10:50.988
No particular prohibited acts.

00:10:50.988 --> 00:10:53.156
How will we determine the winner?

00:10:53.156 --> 00:10:55.092
When one of us is unconscious,

00:10:55.092 --> 00:10:59.696
unable to continue fighting
or declares "I give up."

00:10:59.696 --> 00:11:00.731
What about time?

00:11:00.731 --> 00:11:01.865
No limit.

00:11:01.865 --> 00:11:05.636
I like that. I'm getting excited.

00:11:05.636 --> 00:11:07.037
Well, then...

00:11:07.037 --> 00:11:09.006
Who do you think will win?

00:11:09.006 --> 00:11:13.877
Hard to say, but Silvia is a specialist
at close proximity combat.

00:11:13.877 --> 00:11:15.037
It's starting!

00:11:23.754 --> 00:11:24.755
She's fast!

00:11:24.755 --> 00:11:27.491
Hang in there, Rose!
Give it to her, Silvia!

00:11:27.491 --> 00:11:28.959
Go! Go! Go!

00:11:28.959 --> 00:11:29.857
Oh?

00:11:31.028 --> 00:11:33.563
We continue until one of
us is knocked unconscious

00:11:33.563 --> 00:11:35.531
or is unable to continue.

00:11:41.238 --> 00:11:43.774
Huh? She's done it.

00:11:43.774 --> 00:11:45.435
Is it over?

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:48.910
Are we done already?

00:11:52.549 --> 00:11:54.051
Owowow...

00:11:54.051 --> 00:11:55.252
That hurt!

00:11:55.252 --> 00:11:57.721
Now is your chance to surrender.

00:11:57.721 --> 00:12:00.691
Why? We just got started.

00:12:00.691 --> 00:12:03.293
It'd be a shame to end it now.

00:12:03.293 --> 00:12:04.995
If you hadn't said that...

00:12:04.995 --> 00:12:07.555
I would've been disappointed!

00:12:18.308 --> 00:12:20.210
Huh? What?

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:21.979
I see.

00:12:21.979 --> 00:12:24.214
Rose is wearing her suit...

00:12:24.214 --> 00:12:27.084
...for the first time today...

00:12:27.084 --> 00:12:30.053
It's finally collected
enough of her individual data

00:12:30.053 --> 00:12:33.318
and the suit has begun
to perform as it should.

00:12:36.994 --> 00:12:39.463
I can't hit her!

00:12:39.463 --> 00:12:42.199
I'm finally getting the hang of this suit.

00:12:42.199 --> 00:12:44.334
Bluff all you want!

00:12:44.334 --> 00:12:45.435
You're doing it all wrong.

00:12:45.435 --> 00:12:49.406
You have to save the big techniques
for when you need them.

00:12:49.406 --> 00:12:50.340
Like...

00:12:50.340 --> 00:12:51.932
...this!

00:12:58.281 --> 00:12:59.976
Still want to continue?

00:13:02.953 --> 00:13:04.716
I give up.

00:13:06.056 --> 00:13:07.751
Silvia...

00:13:09.993 --> 00:13:11.824
She lost?

00:13:23.407 --> 00:13:26.343
Silvia, are you all right?

00:13:26.343 --> 00:13:28.111
Don't look at me like that.

00:13:28.111 --> 00:13:30.313
I'm not depressed or anything.

00:13:30.313 --> 00:13:31.848
One day, I'll surpass her

00:13:31.848 --> 00:13:34.217
and get my revenge, that's all.

00:13:34.217 --> 00:13:36.086
- What?!
- Huh?

00:13:36.086 --> 00:13:39.389
That means, one day you'll be our superior?

00:13:39.389 --> 00:13:41.124
I don't know if I like that, either.

00:13:41.124 --> 00:13:42.826
You can say that now...

00:13:42.826 --> 00:13:46.363
Well, I'm going to go take a shower,

00:13:46.363 --> 00:13:47.830
so I'll leave the rest to you.

00:13:52.736 --> 00:13:54.226
Silvia...

00:14:18.195 --> 00:14:19.529
Solty?!

00:14:19.529 --> 00:14:21.087
- What?!
- Solty?!

00:14:23.433 --> 00:14:25.993
I-I just got back.

00:14:27.537 --> 00:14:30.233
Wh-What did you do that for?

00:14:34.044 --> 00:14:36.480
I was so worried!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.748
What were you doing?!

00:14:38.748 --> 00:14:41.216
Welcome back, Solty.

00:14:42.319 --> 00:14:44.287
S-Solty!

00:14:44.287 --> 00:14:45.922
I was so worried about you!

00:14:45.922 --> 00:14:47.257
Are you hurt or anything?

00:14:47.257 --> 00:14:49.493
Are you having any problems?

00:14:49.493 --> 00:14:51.461
Don't touch Solty!

00:14:51.461 --> 00:14:52.863
Wh-Why not?!

00:14:52.863 --> 00:14:55.132
I was worried about Solty!

00:14:55.132 --> 00:14:57.434
Because the way you look at her is creepy!

00:14:57.434 --> 00:14:59.436
Pervert!

00:14:59.436 --> 00:15:02.272
Um, where is Mr. Roy?

00:15:02.272 --> 00:15:04.875
What? You mean he's not with you?

00:15:04.875 --> 00:15:07.043
He went looking for you, Solty.

00:15:07.043 --> 00:15:09.779
What? He did?

00:15:09.779 --> 00:15:11.882
Stare...

00:15:11.882 --> 00:15:13.884
Mom, is the bath ready?

00:15:13.884 --> 00:15:14.651
Yes.

00:15:14.651 --> 00:15:16.353
- Come on, let's go.
- What?

00:15:16.353 --> 00:15:19.022
You're covered with dust and filthy!

00:15:19.022 --> 00:15:20.546
Now, move it!

00:15:23.093 --> 00:15:25.994
Where are you going, Yuto?

00:15:29.232 --> 00:15:30.597
Oh?

00:15:35.705 --> 00:15:38.008
Oh, you're...

00:15:38.008 --> 00:15:40.110
Um, my card's not...

00:15:40.110 --> 00:15:42.412
You haven't heard?

00:15:42.412 --> 00:15:45.081
You've been removed from the program.

00:15:45.081 --> 00:15:48.018
That's why you can't enter
with your card anymore.

00:15:48.018 --> 00:15:48.985
What?

00:15:48.985 --> 00:15:51.154
In other words, you're an outsider now.

00:15:51.154 --> 00:15:53.557
You are prohibited
from ever entering here again.

00:15:53.557 --> 00:15:57.049
If you trespass, you will be punished
for breaching the code of practice.

00:16:05.368 --> 00:16:07.170
I swear...

00:16:07.170 --> 00:16:10.740
So, what is it you wanted to talk about?

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.876
Well, just hear me out.

00:16:12.876 --> 00:16:15.212
When that girl first arrived here,

00:16:15.212 --> 00:16:18.515
her Al was already overloaded.

00:16:18.515 --> 00:16:21.017
I was the one who repaired her.

00:16:21.017 --> 00:16:25.255
It was as though she had been
subjected to extreme stress.

00:16:25.255 --> 00:16:27.120
Do you have any idea why that might be?

00:16:28.491 --> 00:16:30.627
I do.

00:16:30.627 --> 00:16:32.162
What happened?

00:16:32.162 --> 00:16:35.065
I don't owe you an answer.

00:16:35.065 --> 00:16:39.569
Are you aware of what that girl is?

00:16:39.569 --> 00:16:42.105
She may be a mechanical being...

00:16:42.105 --> 00:16:44.374
But so what?

00:16:44.374 --> 00:16:46.276
That's not what I meant.

00:16:46.276 --> 00:16:49.980
Certainly, she possesses
extraordinary abilities.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:52.082
But in time,

00:16:52.082 --> 00:16:56.686
those abilities will endanger
both you and those around you.

00:16:56.686 --> 00:16:58.221
Even knowing that,

00:16:58.221 --> 00:17:03.026
are you still prepared to face
the consequences of living with her?

00:17:03.026 --> 00:17:05.495
Just a minute!

00:17:05.495 --> 00:17:09.866
She is someone I can't live without.

00:17:09.866 --> 00:17:11.231
That's all there is to it.

00:17:19.476 --> 00:17:20.977
Honestly!

00:17:20.977 --> 00:17:24.681
Where were you and what were you
doing with all this dirt all over you?!

00:17:24.681 --> 00:17:28.583
A lot happened. A lot...

00:17:38.728 --> 00:17:43.400
Miss Kasha, I met someone I love.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.602
Huh?

00:17:45.602 --> 00:17:48.838
I am half kidding.

00:17:48.838 --> 00:17:50.607
Wait! What do you mean by that?

00:17:50.607 --> 00:17:52.768
That is how it is.

00:17:55.045 --> 00:17:58.882
What did she mean by "that is how it is"?

00:17:58.882 --> 00:18:02.952
That is the kind of thing
you shouldn't be doing!

00:18:02.952 --> 00:18:05.819
Oh, sorry...

00:18:12.829 --> 00:18:15.365
What?! I'm fired?!

00:18:15.365 --> 00:18:16.333
What?

00:18:16.333 --> 00:18:18.268
"Ms. Celica Yayoi,"

00:18:18.268 --> 00:18:23.206
"Effective today, you are dismissed
for dereliction of duty."

00:18:23.206 --> 00:18:24.674
This can't be!

00:18:24.674 --> 00:18:27.077
Dereliction of duty? What's that mean?

00:18:27.077 --> 00:18:28.878
Dereliction?

00:18:28.878 --> 00:18:31.176
Could it be yesterday's...

00:18:33.183 --> 00:18:35.652
Hey! What's the meaning of this?!

00:18:35.652 --> 00:18:37.153
I don't know.

00:18:37.153 --> 00:18:39.789
I saw it just now myself.

00:18:39.789 --> 00:18:43.493
You're the one who said
that you only cared about results!

00:18:43.493 --> 00:18:45.995
I'm telling you it wasn't me!

00:18:45.995 --> 00:18:47.897
Maybe it was the division chief?

00:18:47.897 --> 00:18:50.500
Why don't you go ask him in person?

00:18:50.500 --> 00:18:52.669
All right.

00:18:52.669 --> 00:18:54.704
I'll go ask him.

00:18:54.704 --> 00:18:57.332
Oh! Silvia!

00:18:59.309 --> 00:19:01.811
Please wait, Silvia!

00:19:01.811 --> 00:19:03.346
Let go of me, Accela!

00:19:03.346 --> 00:19:05.382
It won't do any good right now!

00:19:05.382 --> 00:19:07.550
How do you know that?

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:10.186
Because...

00:19:10.186 --> 00:19:14.088
Rose, from now on, you are
the one I will be counting on.

00:19:16.359 --> 00:19:19.596
A-Anyway, come back to the office for now.

00:19:19.596 --> 00:19:22.165
I have to go there now.

00:19:22.165 --> 00:19:25.464
Starting tomorrow,
Celica won't be one of us!

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:33.643
Division Chief.

00:19:33.643 --> 00:19:36.513
Why did you fire Celica?

00:19:36.513 --> 00:19:41.684
I... We made it this far
because we trusted you.

00:19:41.684 --> 00:19:42.886
I understand.

00:19:42.886 --> 00:19:44.287
You do not understand!

00:19:44.287 --> 00:19:46.823
No. To me as well,

00:19:46.823 --> 00:19:51.995
you were the only people
in this world whom I could trust.

00:19:51.995 --> 00:19:54.998
Then... Why?

00:19:54.998 --> 00:19:58.401
You Proceeds are individuals
who were artificially engineered

00:19:58.401 --> 00:20:01.504
to have various specialized abilities
on the DNA level.

00:20:01.504 --> 00:20:05.375
In a manner of speaking, you are
a new generation of human beings.

00:20:05.375 --> 00:20:08.611
You were the only ones I had,

00:20:08.611 --> 00:20:11.147
who could create my ideal
vision of the world.

00:20:11.147 --> 00:20:13.850
That is why I staked my vision on you.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:15.318
I-I...

00:20:15.318 --> 00:20:18.388
In the process of
working together for so long,

00:20:18.388 --> 00:20:21.758
I realized that feelings beyond
those of a superior for his subordinates

00:20:21.758 --> 00:20:24.561
had blossomed within me.

00:20:24.561 --> 00:20:28.264
I think I needn't say any more
for you to know what I mean.

00:20:28.264 --> 00:20:30.066
B-But...

00:20:30.066 --> 00:20:32.569
Silvia.

00:20:32.569 --> 00:20:35.595
I know how you feel about me.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:41.711
However, all I desire are superior pawns.

00:20:41.711 --> 00:20:42.541
What?

00:20:49.252 --> 00:20:52.119
I have no need for pawns that defy me.

00:20:53.623 --> 00:20:55.058
Rose...

00:20:55.058 --> 00:20:59.295
She is the one I have been waiting for.

00:20:59.295 --> 00:21:02.298
I don't need the rest of you any longer.

00:21:02.298 --> 00:21:06.667
How could you? I trusted you...

00:21:20.817 --> 00:21:21.684
Silvia!

00:21:21.684 --> 00:21:23.276
Silvia!

00:21:24.821 --> 00:21:26.823
Silvia!

00:21:26.823 --> 00:21:28.188
Silence!

00:21:30.627 --> 00:21:32.962
This is what you get
for developing camaraderie

00:21:32.962 --> 00:21:34.657
and other needless emotions.

00:21:36.332 --> 00:21:39.358
You are useless to me now!

00:21:52.479 --> 00:21:57.251
On a clear day in the park

00:21:57.251 --> 00:22:00.187
Looking up at the sky

00:22:00.187 --> 00:22:08.720
There was a tiny little cloud
that almost vanished

00:22:11.465 --> 00:22:16.237
Letting the wind take us where it will

00:22:16.237 --> 00:22:19.173
We live freely

00:22:19.173 --> 00:22:25.237
We make our way,
walking a little at a time

00:22:27.214 --> 00:22:30.183
We're the same

00:22:31.986 --> 00:22:36.724
This precious time

00:22:36.724 --> 00:22:40.561
Each time we meet

00:22:40.561 --> 00:22:50.104
This feeling of not being alone
turns into kindness

00:22:50.104 --> 00:22:56.710
I can turn it into
the courage to believe in someone

00:22:56.710 --> 00:23:09.248
And surely, before I vanish
into the far reaches of that sky...

00:23:15.596 --> 00:23:18.165
This is my home, where I belong.

00:23:18.165 --> 00:23:20.334
And this is also his home.

00:23:20.601 --> 00:23:23.337
Next time, "Welcome Home".

00:23:23.337 --> 00:23:25.271
Dinner is ready.
